gui.wormholetech.tablet.p0.title=Fragment I — Discovery
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p0.l1=[Translation] Looks like some ancient civilization wrote this.
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p0.l2=[Translation] Technology that makes use of wormholes — not magic, but geometry folded thin.
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p0.l3=[Translation] Whatever can be automated, automate. The builders never worked by hand.


gui.wormholetech.tablet.p2.title=Fragment II — Matter
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p2.l1=[Translation] Matter path (craft the ore, mine it, then refine):
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p2.l2=[Translation] Synthetic Ore -> Raw Naquadah (25%%) -> Refined Naquadah (explode the raw item).

