gui.wormholetech.tablet.p3.l2=[Translation] Naquadah Generator (brief) -> Wormhole Energy Converter (steady while a wormhole is open).

gui.wormholetech.tablet.p4.title=Fragment V — Echoes
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p4.l1=[Translation] An item is remembered across a throat of space. Making use of the rematerialization past the event horizon.
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p4.l2=[Translation] A wormhole stays open while a Block of Refined Naquadah decays (ten minutes each). The Unstable Duplicator echoes only once, then collapses.

gui.wormholetech.tablet.p5.title=Fragment IV — Seeking Veins
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p5.l1=[Translation] Tells your machinery what veins to look for.
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p5.l2=[Translation] Requires Immersive Engineering Excavator to extract the minerals.

